These are the DaCHS resource descriptors of the data centre at
Fesenkov Astrophysical Institute.

This is intended to be cloned into DaCHS' rootdir as inputs, something
like this::

  cd /var/gavo
  rmdir inputs
  git clone git@github.com:ill-i/fai-inputs.git inputs

You will then need to do a few symlinks into the common datastore.
TBD: do we give the commands to do that here or in each individual repo.

Testing on lark
---------------

Run all regression suites tracked by this repository with::

  ./test-all-tracked.sh

Do not use ``dachs test ALL`` on lark.  The configured public URL is not
reachable from the host itself, and ``ALL`` also walks mounted data trees
(including NAS snapshot directories).  The helper limits discovery to
Git-tracked resource descriptors, sends requests to the local DaCHS
listener at ``http://127.0.0.1``, and runs them serially to avoid transient
failures from overloading the production TAP service.
